Add a QinQ transport action for IPv4 multicast replication.

Match the switch CPU ingress, both tags and the group MAC. Map the upper
multicast address bits into the S-VID to distinguish aliased MACs. The caller
owns the receiver policy. Share the existing ACL allocator and withdraw
multicast rules with their native steering domains.

